{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-compensation","title":"延迟补偿（服务器端）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/latency-compensation","wordCount":1797,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"延迟补偿-服务器端\">延迟补偿（服务器端）</h1><p>延迟补偿是服务器端架构中最精妙也最容易引发争议的技术——它让高延迟玩家的操作&quot;看起来&quot;是在正确时刻发生的，代价是其他玩家可能在已经躲到掩体后仍被命中。这是一个没有完美解的工程权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务器端延迟补偿的本质是<strong>时间回滚</strong>：服务器维护一个世界状态的历史快照缓冲区，当收到射手的开火输入时，回滚到射手开火时刻的历史世界状态执行命中判定，然后恢复到当前时刻。核心原则是&quot;Favor the Shooter&quot;（偏向射手），代价是被命中者的&quot;掩体后死亡&quot;体验。最大回滚窗口的设定是公平性与手感的直接权衡，sub-tick 系统将精度从 tick 级提升到任意精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要服务器端延迟补偿\">为什么需要服务器端延迟补偿</h2><p>在权威服务器模型下，命中判定由服务器执行。但服务器收到玩家&quot;开火&quot;的输入时，世界已经前进了至少一个 RTT/2 的时间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>shooter</mtext></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>processing</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{offset}} = \\frac{\\text{RTT}_{\\text{shooter}}}{2} + T_{\\text{processing}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shooter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">processing</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于 80ms RTT 的射手，服务器收到开火指令时世界已经前进了约 45ms。如果服务器直接用当前位置判定命中，射手明明瞄准了目标并扣动扳机，但因为延迟，目标已经移走了——&quot;我明明打中了&quot;是最常见的玩家抱怨。</p>\n<p>延迟补偿的核心思想：服务器&quot;回到过去&quot;，在射手开火时的历史世界状态下执行命中判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"服务器端回滚机制\">服务器端回滚机制</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Shooter as 射手(80ms RTT)&#10;    participant Server as 服务器&#10;    participant Target as 目标&#10;    Note over Shooter: T=0: 看到目标在位置X, 开火&#10;    Shooter-&gt;&gt;Server: Fire(tick=100, aim_direction)&#10;    Note over Server: T=40ms: 收到指令, 当前tick=103&#10;    Note over Target: 此时目标已在位置Y(移动了)&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 回滚世界到tick=100&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 在历史状态下执行射线检测&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 命中确认 → 恢复到当前tick=103&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Shooter: Hit confirmed, damage applied&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Target: You were hit (死后视角可能已在掩体后)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Shooter as 射手(80ms RTT)\n    participant Server as 服务器\n    participant Target as 目标\n    Note over Shooter: T=0: 看到目标在位置X, 开火\n    Shooter-&gt;&gt;Server: Fire(tick=100, aim_direction)\n    Note over Server: T=40ms: 收到指令, 当前tick=103\n    Note over Target: 此时目标已在位置Y(移动了)\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 回滚世界到tick=100\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 在历史状态下执行射线检测\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 命中确认 → 恢复到当前tick=103\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Shooter: Hit confirmed, damage applied\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Target: You were hit (死后视角可能已在掩体后)</pre><h2 id=\"历史快照缓冲区\">历史快照缓冲区</h2><p>实现回滚需要服务器维护一个世界状态的历史缓冲区：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>计算依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓冲区深度</td>\n<td>1-2 秒</td>\n<td>覆盖最高允许延迟的玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储帧数</td>\n<td>Tick Rate × 缓冲秒数</td>\n<td>64Hz × 1s = 64 帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每帧数据</td>\n<td>所有实体的碰撞体位置</td>\n<td>仅需碰撞相关数据，非全量状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存开销</td>\n<td>每实体约 64-128 bytes × 实体数 × 帧数</td>\n<td>100 实体 × 128B × 64 帧 ≈ 800KB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>缓冲区使用环形数组实现，按 Tick 号索引：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>index</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>tick_number</mtext><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>buffer_size</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{index} = \\text{tick\\_number} \\mod \\text{buffer\\_size}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">index</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tick_number</span></span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buffer_size</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"回滚判定流程\">回滚判定流程</h2><p>服务器收到一个开火输入后的完整处理流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>确定回滚目标 Tick</strong>：射手声称的开火时刻（由客户端附带的 Tick 号确定）</li>\n<li><strong>验证合理性</strong>：回滚 Tick 不能超过允许的最大延迟（通常 250-500ms）</li>\n<li><strong>回滚碰撞世界</strong>：将所有实体的碰撞体临时移动到历史位置</li>\n<li><strong>执行射线检测</strong>：在历史状态下进行 Raycast</li>\n<li><strong>恢复当前状态</strong>：将碰撞体回到当前位置</li>\n<li><strong>应用结果</strong>：如果命中，在当前世界施加伤害</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键约束：回滚<strong>只影响碰撞判定</strong>，不影响游戏逻辑的推进。世界仍然在当前 Tick 继续运转，只是命中判定&quot;回到过去&quot;了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最大回滚窗口\">最大回滚窗口</h2><p>允许回滚多远是一个策略性决策：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>max_rollback</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>max_acceptable_RTT</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>interp_delay</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>margin</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{max\\_rollback}} = T_{\\text{max\\_acceptable\\_RTT}} / 2 + T_{\\text{interp\\_delay}} + T_{\\text{margin}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max_rollback</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max_acceptable_RTT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">interp_delay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">margin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>游戏</th>\n<th>最大回滚</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Valorant</td>\n<td>~200ms</td>\n<td>严格，超过阈值降低命中优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overwatch 2</td>\n<td>~250ms</td>\n<td>中等，对极高延迟玩家生效弱化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Call of Duty</td>\n<td>~300ms</td>\n<td>宽松，优先&quot;打到就是打到&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CS2 (sub-tick)</td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td>基于 sub-tick 精确时间戳计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>设定过大的回滚窗口会导致&quot;掩体后死亡&quot;问题恶化；设定过小会让高 ping 玩家完全无法命中移动目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"favor-the-shooter-原则\">Favor the Shooter 原则</h2><p>大多数 FPS 游戏采用&quot;偏向射手&quot;原则：如果射手在自己的屏幕上看到目标被命中，服务器倾向于确认这次命中。理由：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>射手的主观体验中&quot;我瞄准了并扣动了扳机&quot;是最直觉的因果关系</li>\n<li>让射手的操作无效会直接损害游戏的手感反馈</li>\n<li>被命中者大多数情况下不会意识到延迟补偿的存在</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>对被命中者的影响</strong>：</p>\n<p>被命中者可能经历&quot;我已经躲到墙后面了但还是被打中了&quot;的情况。这发生在：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>peeker’s_advantage</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>shooter</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>interp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{peeker&#x27;s\\_advantage}} = \\text{RTT}_{\\text{shooter}} + T_{\\text{interp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peeker’s_advantage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shooter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">interp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果射手 RTT = 80ms，插值延迟 = 100ms，被命中者会在自己认为已经安全 180ms 后仍然受到伤害。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多射手冲突仲裁\">多射手冲突仲裁</h2><p>当两个玩家同时向对方开火，且双方的延迟补偿回滚都显示命中时：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[玩家A 开火 tick=100] --&gt; ServerA{服务器回滚到tick=100}&#10;    B[玩家B 开火 tick=101] --&gt; ServerB{服务器回滚到tick=101}&#10;    ServerA --&gt;|命中B| DmgB[B 受伤]&#10;    ServerB --&gt;|命中A| DmgA[A 受伤]&#10;    DmgA --&gt; Check{双方是否同时死亡?}&#10;    DmgB --&gt; Check&#10;    Check --&gt;|允许| Trade[互换击杀 Trade Kill]&#10;    Check --&gt;|不允许| Priority[按服务器接收顺序优先]\">flowchart TD\n    A[玩家A 开火 tick=100] --&gt; ServerA{服务器回滚到tick=100}\n    B[玩家B 开火 tick=101] --&gt; ServerB{服务器回滚到tick=101}\n    ServerA --&gt;|命中B| DmgB[B 受伤]\n    ServerB --&gt;|命中A| DmgA[A 受伤]\n    DmgA --&gt; Check{双方是否同时死亡?}\n    DmgB --&gt; Check\n    Check --&gt;|允许| Trade[互换击杀 Trade Kill]\n    Check --&gt;|不允许| Priority[按服务器接收顺序优先]</pre><p>不同游戏的策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>游戏示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>允许 Trade Kill</td>\n<td>双方都判定命中，即使结果是同时死亡</td>\n<td>大部分 FPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先到先得</td>\n<td>服务器先处理的击杀生效，后者无效</td>\n<td>部分格斗游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳优先</td>\n<td>客户端报告的开火时间更早者优先</td>\n<td>极少使用（易作弊）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sub-tick-延迟补偿\">Sub-tick 延迟补偿</h2><p>CS2 引入的 sub-tick 系统将延迟补偿精度从 tick 级别提升到任意精度：</p>\n<p>传统方式：射手输入在某个 tick 被处理，回滚到该 tick 的历史状态。精度受限于 tick 间隔（如 64Hz = 15.6ms 精度）。</p>\n<p>Sub-tick 方式：客户端在输入中附带精确的 tick 内偏移时间（如 &quot;tick 100 + 7.3ms&quot;），服务器在两帧历史状态之间进行插值，获得更精确的历史位置。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>interpolated</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>tick_N</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>tick_N+1</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>tick_N</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{interpolated}} = P_{\\text{tick\\_N}} + (P_{\\text{tick\\_N+1}} - P_{\\text{tick\\_N}}) \\times \\frac{t_{\\text{offset}}}{\\Delta t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">interpolated</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tick_N</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tick_N+1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tick_N</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9781em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这消除了&quot;开火时刻恰好在 tick 边界的哪一侧&quot;对命中判定的影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟补偿的滥用防御\">延迟补偿的滥用防御</h2><p>延迟补偿本身可以被恶意利用：</p>\n<p><strong>人为增加延迟</strong>：玩家使用延迟模拟工具增加自己的 RTT，获得更大的回滚窗口（Peeker&#39;s Advantage 变大）。</p>\n<p>防御措施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设定回滚上限（超过阈值开始衰减命中优先级）</li>\n<li>延迟惩罚：高 RTT 玩家的命中判定使用更小的碰撞体</li>\n<li>延迟稳定性检测：RTT 突然上升 → 标记为可疑</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>时间戳伪造</strong>：客户端伪造更早的开火时间以获得更有利的历史状态。</p>\n<p>防御措施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务器独立追踪每个客户端的时间偏移</li>\n<li>客户端声称的 Tick 不能超过服务器估算的可能范围</li>\n<li>异常时间戳 → 使用服务器估算的时间代替</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>延迟补偿是权威服务器模型下让高 ping 玩家仍能公平游戏的核心技术。它以历史快照缓冲区为基础、时间回滚为手段、Favor the Shooter 为设计哲学，在射手手感和被命中者体验之间做了一个有意识的取舍。最大回滚窗口是可调的策略参数——设得宽则高 ping 友好但掩体后死亡严重，设得窄则反之。Sub-tick 进一步消除了 tick 粒度的精度损失。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"protocol-design\">协议设计</a>提供了时间戳在数据包中的传输方式；<a href=\"bandwidth-optimization\">带宽优化</a>讲解历史快照的压缩存储策略。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"延迟补偿（服务器端）","id":"延迟补偿-服务器端"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要服务器端延迟补偿","id":"为什么需要服务器端延迟补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"服务器端回滚机制","id":"服务器端回滚机制"},{"level":2,"text":"历史快照缓冲区","id":"历史快照缓冲区"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚判定流程","id":"回滚判定流程"},{"level":2,"text":"最大回滚窗口","id":"最大回滚窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"Favor the Shooter 原则","id":"favor-the-shooter-原则"},{"level":2,"text":"多射手冲突仲裁","id":"多射手冲突仲裁"},{"level":2,"text":"Sub-tick 延迟补偿","id":"sub-tick-延迟补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟补偿的滥用防御","id":"延迟补偿的滥用防御"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/protocol-design"},"next":{"title":"带宽优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/bandwidth-optimization"}}